  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-writer/1/manifest.json",
    "title": "知识写作角色运行清单",
    "summary": "该清单定义 knowledge-writer 第 1 版：加载内联写作技能，输出 KnowledgeBatch.v1，并采用无工具、无会话复用和不继承用户扩展的隔离配置；其预算与复核角色同量级。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "writer-contract",
        "title": "写作角色与产物",
        "body": "清单把运行单元标识为 `knowledge-writer` 第 1 版，使用 `traex` profile 和 `prompt.md`，并以内联方式加载带制品摘要的 `omem-knowledge-writer` 第 1 版技能。其输出 schema 是 `KnowledgeBatch.v1`，表明配置职责是生成结构化知识批次，而非作出 KnowledgeReview 判定。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "runtime-boundaries",
        "title": "运行隔离与容量",
        "body": "写作角色配置为完全禁用工具，每次建立新会话，且不继承用户技能或 MCP；这使其依赖宿主显式提供的材料与角色资源。上下文和输出上限分别为 96,000 与 24,000 token，结构修复最多尝试两次。[[c2]] 这些内容证明当前清单如何声明角色，不证明写作质量、引用语义核验或宿主执行状态；独立复核仍需由另一角色完成。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "知识写作角色与输出声明",
        "reason": "支持 writer 的角色版本、profile、内联技能制品及 KnowledgeBatch.v1 输出职责。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-writer/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 2,
          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"role_id\": \"knowledge-writer\",\n  \"role_version\": \"1\",\n  \"profile_ref\": \"traex\",\n  \"prompt_templates\": [\n    \"prompt.md\"\n  ],\n  \"skill_bundles\": [\n    {\n      \"canonical_name\": \"omem-knowledge-writer\",\n      \"version\": \"1\",\n      \"load_mode\": \"inline\",\n      \"artifact_digest\": \"4dcfb9d9f050bb713"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "知识写作角色隔离与预算",
        "reason": "支持无工具、会话不复用、不继承用户扩展以及上下文、输出和修复预算的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-writer/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 18,
          "endLine": 30
        },
        "quote": "  \"tool_policy\": {\n    \"mode\": \"none\",\n    \"allowed_tools\": []\n  },\n  \"session_policy\": {\n    \"reuse\": \"never\",\n    \"inherit_user_skills\": false,\n    \"inherit_user_mcp\": false\n  },\n  \"budget\": {\n    \"max_context_tokens\": 96000,\n    \"max_output_tokens\": 24000,\n    \"max_repair_attempts\": 2"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "知识写作角色生成的 KnowledgeBatch.v1 是否必经独立 knowledge-verifier 后才能发布？",
        "why": "当前清单只描述 writer 自身的产物和隔离策略，没有给出 writer、verifier 与发布步骤之间的编排或失败处理。",
        "nextStep": "检查知识任务编排配置或运行 trace，确认复核是否强制、修订如何回流以及未通过结果是否会被发布。",
        "blocking": false,
